{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/option1-616x300_1.gif?t=1744300732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help <strong><i>Zirian</i></strong> save his sister from the claws of Despair by restoring the fabric of time and uncovering the secrets of the <strong><i>Master Clockmakers</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/Spectacular_clockpunk-EN.png?t=1744300732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore stunning realms shaped by the <strong><i>Master Clockmakers</i></strong>, each f<i>illed with mystery, magic, breathtaking vistas</i>, and endearing characters. Navigate ethereal forests, underwater realms, sunlit dunes and cloudy heights - the world of <strong><i>Duskfade</i></strong> is alive and teems with secrets for you to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1744300732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/Action_Platformer-EN.png?t=1744300732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a seamless blend of <i>dynamic platforming and fast-paced combat</i>. Jump, dash, grapple, and glide your way through thrilling challenges that rekindle the magic of classic action platformer favourites.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1744300732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/A_tale_as_old-EN.png?t=1744300732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Experience a powerful coming-of-age journey filled with heart</i>, loss, and the courage to face the unknown. Join a cast of charming characters to face down long forgotten foes, each embodying an emotional hurdle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/Gif_3.2.gif?t=1744300732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2542020?t=1744300732","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/7d3264f1d7c897d4f239f81c28e695b2401f391c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744300732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/adbbe51e276a6298051a2d7b605ef6005b307094/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744300732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/adbbe51e276a6298051a2d7b605ef6005b307094/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744300732","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542020/extras/option1-616x300_1.gif?t=1744300732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragr